+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Autoescape selection
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Make the default autoescape selector match supported template extensions without regard to filename case, and verify supported uppercase and mixed-case names return `True`.
+
+## 2. Regression coverage
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add focused tests for case-insensitive supported extensions while retaining coverage for unsupported and unnamed filenames, and verify with `PYTHONPATH=src:.bench-pydeps python3 -m pytest tests -q`.
